{
 "uid": "utm-obs-06-opplans",
 "title": "06 - Operation Plan Lifecycle",
 "description": "**Purpose:** lifecycle view of live UTM operation plans and their authorisation/activation outcomes.\n\n**Data sources:** Elasticsearch `core-es7` — `operation-plan-wrapper` (time field `operationPlan.submitTime`) and `operation-plan-result` (time field `operationPlanResult.startTime`).\n\n**Counting rule:** all counts come from parent-document aggregations. `_cat/indices` inflates these indices because `operationPlan.operationVolumes`, `aircraftInfos` and `uasRegistrations` are nested types — never use `docs.count` as a plan count.\n\n**Data freshness:** submitTime spans 2026-04-15 → 2026-05-12. Not a live feed.\n\n**Known gap:** `ops-subscription` cannot be visualised — all fields are non-aggregatable `text` and the index has no date field. See the panel at the foot of this dashboard.",
 "tags": [
  "utm-observability",
  "operations"
 ],
 "timezone": "browser",
 "editable": true,
 "graphTooltip": 1,
 "schemaVersion": 41,
 "version": 0,
 "weekStart": "",
 "refresh": "1m",
 "preload": false,
