    "code": {
     "language": "plaintext",
     "showLineNumbers": false,
     "showMiniMap": false
    },
    "content": "**No derived index is used here.** `operation-plan-wrapper` stores four **parent-level `geo_point`** fields, which Grafana aggregates directly. (Dashboard 05 needed a derivation only because zone geometry is `geo_shape` inside a `nested` field.)\n\n**Coverage is not uniform** — compare the stats to the left against *Total Live Plans*. A plan missing `takeoffLocation` is absent from that map but still counted everywhere else on this dashboard.\n\n**Two operational theatres.** Verified geohash clusters: Philippines (~14°N 121°E, operator `PH-DRN-REG-AX1B2`) and Sweden (~59°N 15°E, operator `FRQ`). The arithmetic centroid of all plans falls in open ocean between them, which is why both maps fit to data rather than centring.\n\n**Trajectories are not plotted.** `operationTrajectory.trajectoryElements` holds lat/lon as separate float arrays; flattening loses the pairing, so drawing flight paths would require a derivation like dashboard 05's."
